{"path":"docs/agents/domain.md","ref":"1f305ea273a1133774b6a1eda851a5ad99278ad3","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":1,"text":"# Domain Docs"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":3,"text":"How the engineering skills should consume this repo's domain documentation when exploring the codebase."},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":5,"text":"## Before exploring, read these"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":7,"text":"- **`CONTEXT.md`** at the repo root, or"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":8,"text":"- **`CONTEXT-MAP.md`** at the repo root if it exists — it points at one `CONTEXT.md` per context. Read each one relevant to the topic."},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":9,"text":"- **`docs/adr/`** — read ADRs that touch the area you're about to work in. In multi-context repos, also check `src/<context>/docs/adr/` for context-scoped decisions."},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":10,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":11,"text":"If any of these files don't exist, **proceed silently**. Don't flag their absence; don't suggest creating them upfront. The `/domain-modeling` skill (reached via `/grill-with-docs` and `/improve-codebase-architecture`) creates them lazily when terms or decisions actually get resolved."},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":12,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":13,"text":"## File structure"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":14,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":15,"text":"Single-context repo (most repos):"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":16,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":17,"text":"```"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":18,"text":"/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":19,"text":"├── CONTEXT.md"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":20,"text":"├── docs/adr/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":21,"text":"│   ├── 0001-event-sourced-orders.md"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":22,"text":"│   └── 0002-postgres-for-write-model.md"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":23,"text":"└── src/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":24,"text":"```"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":26,"text":"Multi-context repo (presence of `CONTEXT-MAP.md` at the root):"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":27,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":28,"text":"```"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":29,"text":"/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":30,"text":"├── CONTEXT-MAP.md"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":31,"text":"├── docs/adr/                          ← system-wide decisions"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":32,"text":"└── src/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":33,"text":"    ├── ordering/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":34,"text":"    │   ├── CONTEXT.md"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":35,"text":"    │   └── docs/adr/                  ← context-specific decisions"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":36,"text":"    └── billing/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":37,"text":"        ├── CONTEXT.md"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":38,"text":"        └── docs/adr/"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":39,"text":"```"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":40,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":41,"text":"## Use the glossary's vocabulary"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":42,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":43,"text":"When your output names a domain concept (in an issue title, a refactor proposal, a hypothesis, a test name), use the term as defined in `CONTEXT.md`. Don't drift to synonyms the glossary explicitly avoids."},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":44,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":45,"text":"If the concept you need isn't in the glossary yet, that's a signal — either you're inventing language the project doesn't use (reconsider) or there's a real gap (note it for `/domain-modeling`)."},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":46,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":47,"text":"## Flag ADR conflicts"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":48,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":49,"text":"If your output contradicts an existing ADR, surface it explicitly rather than silently overriding:"},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":50,"text":""},{"sha":"aa7147f27ec7b9041c123246d38eea723f1c4e8c","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781980281,"line":51,"text":"> _Contradicts ADR-0007 (event-sourced orders) — but worth reopening because…_"}]}
